; ============================================================ ; the S box is written into the tape  ONCE
                                                               ; ASSERT zero 0:884
                                                               ; THE AES S BOX LAID INTO THE TAPE  256 data at a
                                                               ; stride of three  for whichever cipher is about to
                                                               ; read them; Entered at the block's own zero and it
                                                               ; LEAVES THE POINTER AT CELL 45  which is the round
                                                               ; constant's cell and where block/aes128encrypt expects
                                                               ; to begin;
;
                                                               ; THAT SEAM IS THE WHOLE REASON THIS IS A SEPARATE
                                                               ; FILE; a mode encrypts many blocks and the table only
                                                               ; has to be written once; It cannot simply be written
                                                               ; twice either  which is the part that would have
                                                               ; bitten quietly: block/sbox256 is a DELTA CODED run of
                                                               ; plus and minus signs and it assumes every cell begins
                                                               ; at NOUGHT; Laid down over itself the second pass adds
                                                               ; to the first  the table is wrong in all 256 places
                                                               ; and the cipher produces sixteen plausible bytes that
                                                               ; are not the ciphertext; So the lay down lives here
                                                               ; the rounds live next door  and a caller runs this
                                                               ; ONCE;
;
                                                               ; THE SPLIT FALLS WHERE IT DOES SO THE INSTRUCTIONS DO
                                                               ; NOT MOVE; this file ends on the walk home from the
                                                               ; table and the next one opens on the round constant
                                                               ; so the two concatenated are byte for byte the stream
                                                               ; that was here before the split; Ending at nought
                                                               ; instead would have cost a longer walk home and a walk
                                                               ; back out  and changed every artifact to buy tidiness;
;
                                                               ; THE TABLE SURVIVES A FORWARD BLOCK; block/walk256
                                                               ; copies the datum it reads and puts it back  so the S
                                                               ; box is still readable afterwards and a mode in
                                                               ; counter or cipher block chaining mode never lays it
                                                               ; again; The INVERSE cipher is not so lucky: it swaps
                                                               ; the resident table for the inverse one halfway
                                                               ; through  and block/aes128decrypt says so in its own
                                                               ; header;
;
                                                               ; CONTRACTS ARE RELATIVE; every one is a claim about a
                                                               ; cell of THIS block and the include's offset resolves
                                                               ; it; CONVENTIONS section 6 carries the rule;
;
                                                               ; TAPE MAP  (relative to the block's own zero)
;   @0x02d  rcon  where the pointer is left standing
;   @0x072:0x074  group 0 of the walk; ITS TRAIL IS NEVER SET
;   @0x075:0x374  groups 1 to 256  the S box

; ============================================================ ; the S box is written into the tape  one datum per
                                                               ; group
                                                               ; block/sbox256 lands its first datum where the pointer
                                                               ; stands and its last 765 cells further on
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
  >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>   ; continued
  >                                                            ; continued
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=117
                                                               ; S the AES S box  two hundred and fifty six entries
                                                               ; one to a line laid out for the stride three walk:
                                                               ; datum  walker  trail  so each entry is followed by a
                                                               ; step of three; the caller walks in to the first datum
                                                               ; and back out from the last;
;
                                                               ; FIPS 197 section 5 point 1 point 1; DERIVED and not
                                                               ; typed  and the form is the one sha256/hashcore uses
                                                               ; for its round constants: a comment naming the value
                                                               ; then a delta coded run  shorter direction  which
                                                               ; leans on the cell wrapping at 256 and halves the
                                                               ; cost;
;
                                                               ; It is the multiplicative inverse in GF(2^8) then an
                                                               ; affine transform; block/invsbox256 is the same
                                                               ; permutation read backwards; S of 0x00 is 0x63
