                                                               ; IT IS THE SECOND HALF OF BOTH ShiftRows AND ITS
                                                               ; INVERSE; the permutation is a cycle  so a single pass
                                                               ; would overwrite a byte still wanted; pass one moves
                                                               ; every source to its destination in the temporary
