                                                               ; SP 800_90A's CTR_DRBG UPDATE  section 10 point 2
                                                               ; point 1 point 2  for AES_128 with NO derivation
                                                               ; function  where seedlen is thirty two bytes;
;
                                                               ; temp is AES of K over V stepped once  then over V
                                                               ; stepped twice   temp = temp exclusive or
                                                               ; provided_data   K = temp's first sixteen bytes   V =
                                                               ; its last sixteen
;
                                                               ; TWO CIPHER RUNS WRITTEN AS A LOOP OF TWO  and that is
                                                               ; not tidiness; each include of block/aes128encrypt is
                                                               ; about a hundred and seventy six thousand instructions
                                                               ; of PROGRAM TEXT  and this block is itself included
                                                               ; twice  so writing the two runs out would put four
                                                               ; copies in the file where there are now two; The
                                                               ; generate loop next door holds the third and last;
;
                                                               ; THE LOOP BODY CAN BE THE SAME BOTH TIMES because
                                                               ; everything that differs between the two halves is on
                                                               ; a CONVEYOR; provided_data is thirty two cells that
                                                               ; give up their head and slide  and the answer is
                                                               ; thirty two cells that slide and take a new tail; So
                                                               ; the first turn consumes bytes nought to fifteen and
                                                               ; the second sixteen to thirty one  without either turn
                                                               ; knowing which it is;
;
                                                               ; AND THE PROVIDED DATA IS SPENT  which is what makes
                                                               ; the trailing update free: the instantiate call
                                                               ; consumes the entropy into the exclusive or  so those
                                                               ; thirty two cells are already nought when the second
                                                               ; call runs  and exclusive or with nought is what SP
                                                               ; 800_90A asks for there;
;
                                                               ; CONTRACTS ARE RELATIVE; this block is included at
                                                               ; offset nought twice  so they resolve to the addresses
                                                               ; its caller's tape map names;
;
                                                               ; TAPE MAP  (relative to the block's own zero  which is
                                                               ; its caller's)
;   @0x000:0x374  the cipher's frame
;   @0x375:0x384  K{16}   the generator's key  replaced at the end
;   @0x385:0x3a4  OUT{32} the answer  filled tail first over thirty two turns
;   @0x3a5:0x3c4  PRV{32} provided data  SPENT
;   @0x3c7:0x3d6  V{16}   the counter  stepped twice  replaced at the end
;
                                                               ; ASSERT ptr=0
